Welcome to Girls Town! Here you can find almost all kinds of girl games that you can imagine, like dressing up, cooking, hairdressing, makeup, shopping, making friends, designing houses and raising pets! You can explore any corner of Girls Town and create your own story about girls here!

CREATE EVERYTHING YOU WANT
Girls Town is designed for you! Here you can create the unique character, design and decorate your dream house and cook your favorite dishes. Create as you can imagine!

EXPLORE ANY PLACE
There are many different places in the town waiting for you to explore! Shop at the shopping mall for vacation clothes. Head to the beauty store and find lipsticks, eye shadow and other makeup tools you like. Go to the pet store and buy dog food, toys, clothing and more for your pet!

MAKE FRIENDS IN TOWN
The residents in the town can't wait to meet you, including the proud girl Caroline, cheerful Judy, gentle Anna and the lady boss of the grocery store! Join them now and create wonderful stories of the town together!

In Girls Town, every day is lively and colorful! Come and discover more fun activities here!

FEATURES:
- Create your own characters;
- Explore all places in the town;
- 130 types of furniture to design your dream house;
- 297 types of clothes and accessories;
- 100+ makeup tools for you to choose and buy freely;
- Design or choose your favorite hairstyle;
- Meet 16 cute pets and play with them;
- Make friends with people with different personalities;
- A completely open Girls Town with no rules.

