Welcome to the kitten’s house!

Entertaining kids game for boys and girls with funny characters from famous cartoon Kid-E-Cats.

We’ve built you four floors of fun – Daddy’s Office, the Kittens' Bedroom, the Kitchen, the Living Room, Mommy’s Office, the Basement, the Attic Exercise Room, and more – where you can play and have fun with your favorite characters. Look closely! Every room is full of hidden surprises. Peek in the closet and the dresser, the refrigerator and the pantry. You can investigate anything you want. Dress the kittens in different outfits, think of games and stories for them and record your own cartoons and share them with friends all over the world. 

Features and capabilities:

• a game based on an educational cartoon Kid-E-Cats;
• easy controls for the youngest fans;
• stimulates children’s imagination and helps them learn;
• more than 20 unique characters;

Let’s play free funny game with cute kittens.

A new shopping mall has opened in Little Panda's Town. There are so many stores inside the mall, such as a clothing store, music restaurant, supermarket, and ice cream shop. Come and shop with your town friends!

CLOTHING STORE
Check out the new arrivals at the clothing store! The princess dress, sun hat and chain bag, which one do you like? Come on, just try them on! When you are tired, you can take a break in the lounge. You can also read the fashion magazines next to the sofa to relieve your boredom.

SUPERMARKET
There are so many types of products in the supermarket, such as fruits, dolls, daily necessities and many more. Come and buy what you need! Look, candies are on sale. Let's buy some candies! Don't forget to weigh the candies before you buy them!

MUSIC RESTAURANT
Something smells so good. Oh, it's roast chicken. Where does it come from? It turns out to be a music restaurant! Let's go inside and see what else it has! It's a good place to enjoy delicious food while listening to great music!

BEAUTY SALON
How about going to a beauty salon to get yourself a new hairstyle? Green wavy hair, red afro... Any of these hairstyles can show your distinctive personality! Or get a manicure or a facial? There are enough hair and beauty treatments to keep you relaxed for the day!

Other stores such as the toy store and arcade are waiting for you too. Come to the town's mall and have a good shopping time!

FEATURES:
- An open world for you to explore and create endless stories;
- Without any time limit or any rules, you can go anywhere you want;
- 4 floors with 10+ areas to play in;
- Create characters freely and play with them;
- 1,000+ items to use;
- New contents are added to the game according to seasons and popular holidays;
- 60+ kinds of food that kids love.

