Every girl dreams of owning her own doll salon! Now, this doll salon game can make the girls' dream come true! Come and create your very own doll! Dress up your dolls with fantastic makeup and clothes!

CREATE A CHARACTER
The dolls have three skin tones for you to choose from. Just pick the one you like to create a character. You can customize your doll the way you like. From hair to clothes and makeup to nails, you can mix and match everything to design different looks for your doll!

DRESS UP THE DOLL
Here, you can find everything you need to customize your doll with: clothes, accessories, cosmetics and hair tools! You can dress up your doll with various fantastic combinations. Change the doll's hair, DIY beautiful nails, design makeup, and choose jewelry for your doll to make her style shine!

TAKE PHOTOS
The doll salon offers 3 fantastic themed scenes: Beach, Cruise Ship, and Cherry Blossom. Pick your favorite scene, dress up your doll by mixing and matching clothes for her to fit the atmosphere, and take a perfect photo for her to pass the level and win prizes!

Now, girls! Come to the doll salon to create a character, dress up dolls, and show off your creativity!

FEATURES:
- Make every girl's doll salon dream come true;
- Dolls of 3 skin tones to choose from;
- Create your own cute doll;
- Nearly 300 kinds of clothes, accessories, makeup and nail tools;
- 3 fantasy level maps to test your dress-up skills;
- Mix and match freely and give full play to your creativity;
- Play offline anytime and anywhere!

